{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Twilight Traveller</i>, you take on the role of a lone wanderer seeking a place to call home in a mystical world fractured by magical decay. This cozy isometric 3D adventure invites you to explore various biomes, collect elemental essence, restore crystals, and build a home - all whilst bonding with Robert the frog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/8dc522f40d71cef88c6d22274aed033a.poster.avif?t=1751644519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/8dc522f40d71cef88c6d22274aed033a.webm?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/8dc522f40d71cef88c6d22274aed033a.mp4?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world to discover lore, enjoy activities like camping &amp; fishing, and soak in the atmosphere. Feeling lonely? why not invite Robert to keep you company whilst doing activities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/cd00504be640dc2da0f369fcb4496374.poster.avif?t=1751644519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/cd00504be640dc2da0f369fcb4496374.webm?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/cd00504be640dc2da0f369fcb4496374.mp4?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect elemental essence from crystal shards found throughout the world.\u00a0 But crystal shards aren't the only thing waiting to be found! discover other items whilst exploring &amp; foraging, extracting elemental essence from them, or perhaps adding them to your cooking recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/27e93345c62a428bb9db960c67f339e5.poster.avif?t=1751644519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/27e93345c62a428bb9db960c67f339e5.webm?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/27e93345c62a428bb9db960c67f339e5.mp4?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your collected elemental essence to cleanse each of the aether crystals, the main crystals through which the worlds magic flows. With the crystals restored, the world comes back to life &amp; Robert will be able to use the restored magic to help you build a home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/302493684b6034640b9fc0b843c2c6b5.poster.avif?t=1751644519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/302493684b6034640b9fc0b843c2c6b5.webm?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/302493684b6034640b9fc0b843c2c6b5.mp4?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cleansing crystals isn\u2019t easy, so you\u2019ll need a place to rest and call your own. After cleansing your first crystal, Robert will use its restored magic to help rebuild one of the many ruined homes scattered across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once restored, your home becomes your sanctuary. Use elemental essence to fabricate furniture, decorations, and other customisations, turning the space into something uniquely yours.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3829500?t=1751644519","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/a83a732e174a3a286a1d9ed0ac0537d41d138e26/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751644519","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/c94f12bd3a245e7d76033820413db2eff0a01698/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751644519","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/c94f12bd3a245e7d76033820413db2eff0a01698/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751644519","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Twilight Traveller</i>, you take on the role of a lone wanderer seeking a place to call home in a mystical world fractured by magical decay. This cozy isometric 3D adventure invites you to explore various biomes, collect elemental essence, restore crystals, and build a home - all whilst bonding with Robert the frog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/8dc522f40d71cef88c6d22274aed033a.poster.avif?t=1751644519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/8dc522f40d71cef88c6d22274aed033a.webm?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/8dc522f40d71cef88c6d22274aed033a.mp4?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world to discover lore, enjoy activities like camping &amp; fishing, and soak in the atmosphere. Feeling lonely? why not invite Robert to keep you company whilst doing activities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/cd00504be640dc2da0f369fcb4496374.poster.avif?t=1751644519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/cd00504be640dc2da0f369fcb4496374.webm?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/cd00504be640dc2da0f369fcb4496374.mp4?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect elemental essence from crystal shards found throughout the world.\u00a0 But crystal shards aren't the only thing waiting to be found! discover other items whilst exploring &amp; foraging, extracting elemental essence from them, or perhaps adding them to your cooking recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/27e93345c62a428bb9db960c67f339e5.poster.avif?t=1751644519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/27e93345c62a428bb9db960c67f339e5.webm?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/27e93345c62a428bb9db960c67f339e5.mp4?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your collected elemental essence to cleanse each of the aether crystals, the main crystals through which the worlds magic flows. With the crystals restored, the world comes back to life &amp; Robert will be able to use the restored magic to help you build a home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/302493684b6034640b9fc0b843c2c6b5.poster.avif?t=1751644519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/302493684b6034640b9fc0b843c2c6b5.webm?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/extras/302493684b6034640b9fc0b843c2c6b5.mp4?t=1751644519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cleansing crystals isn\u2019t easy, so you\u2019ll need a place to rest and call your own. After cleansing your first crystal, Robert will use its restored magic to help rebuild one of the many ruined homes scattered across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once restored, your home becomes your sanctuary. Use elemental essence to fabricate furniture, decorations, and other customisations, turning the space into something uniquely yours.</p>","developers":["Snowscape Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829500/3e7da63559e9c6092ae53e566933cce200c9f366/header.jpg?t=1751644519","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Twilight Traveller","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Snowscape Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"com